00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:15.098
- Yeah, it was all hundreds. People start thinking, "Well, $500 a month.

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:17.475
I'm a freshman. I'm gonna have this for three years."

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:19.978
- [Laughing]

